From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Branson <andrew.branson@jolla.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 11:52:36 +0200
Subject: [sailfishos][egl] Define platform image import targets

Move Qt's native EGLDisplay lookup to the embedding layer and cache the
borrowed display before Gecko starts.

Classify each EGLImage surface at creation so EmbedLite consumers import
Mesa images as 2D textures and Hybris images as external textures. Expose
nonblocking producer-fence status for UI presentation.
